Wait.

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:58.260
Thank you so much.

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:01.300
Oh, right.

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:12.270
He did help capture the perverts.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:14.840
Yeah. We have to at least acknowledge that.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:15.680
You're right.

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:17.680
That was fun.

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:19.650
Will they come back again?

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:22.150
I want to eat noodles again.

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:24.690
He fried them perfectly.

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:28.490
Well, a lot happened this time.

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:30.430
In the end, he scored a zero sum.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:33.160
No, let's make it negative two.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:35.200
How strict.

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:43.170
You have your own rules, huh?

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:46.710
Pretty much.
I don't do it to those who hate it.

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:50.180
But it's pretty much just like physical contact for me.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.950
Is that so? But I'm glad.

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:54.020
About what?

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.220
Being a pervert is what makes you you.

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:57.520
What?

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:00.120
So you approve of it?

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:01.790
Cheating is allowed.

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:02.990
You idiot.

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:05.460
Police station

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:10.160
How honorable of you.

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:13.740
Willing to share our pain?
I'm so touched.

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:18.370
You got worried and came for us?
You're wonderful, Streak Lord.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:23.610
Like I said, I'm not your comrade!

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:43.300
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:48.540
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:53.680
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:59.010
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:02.080
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:04.590
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:07.320
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:10.790
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.730
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:16.400
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.670
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.070
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:26.810
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:35.650
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight</i>

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:38.390
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:41.990
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:54.100
Inukami!

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.040
See you!

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:56.200
Next episode preview

00:22:56.200 --> 00:22:59.640
Cherry blossoms are the Japanese's favorite flower.

00:23:00.070 --> 00:23:02.780
They've been planted for centuries.

00:23:02.780 --> 00:23:05.750
It was said the rice field God descended there.

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:09.180
Many were planted for religion or fortune telling.

00:23:09.420 --> 00:23:13.320
To admire cherry blossoms is to wish for a good harvest,

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:15.360
and to think of loved ones.

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:17.330
It is a beautiful deed.

00:23:18.030 --> 00:23:19.330
Next on Inukami.

00:23:19.730 --> 00:23:22.430
"Memories of Cherry Blossoms!"

00:23:22.430 --> 00:23:25.070
Let's relive those days of youth.
